      "description": "Solid five-tab bar; terracotta active pill behind the icon.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-nav__tab is-on\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-nav__ico\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14.106 5.553a2 2 0 0 0 1.788 0l3.659-1.83A1 1 0 0 1 21 4.619v12.764a1 1 0 0 1-.553.894l-4.553 2.277a2 2 0 0 1-1.788 0l-4.212-2.106a2 2 0 0 0-1.788 0l-3.659 1.83A1 1 0 0 1 3 19.381V6.618a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894l4.553-2.277a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0z\"/><path d=\"M15 5.764v15\"/><path d=\"M9 3.236v15\"/></svg></span>Mapa</a><a class=\"ds-nav__tab\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-nav__ico\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 12h.01M3 18h.01M3 6h.01M8 12h13M8 18h13M8 6h13\"/></svg></span>Miejsca</a><a class=\"ds-nav__tab\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-nav__ico\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"19\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M9 19h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-11a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H15\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/></svg></span>Plany</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;width:360px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border,oklch(0.88 0.02 70));background:var(--color-background,oklch(0.98 0.012 80))}.ds-nav__tab{flex:1;min-height:60px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;font:400 12px/1 Outfit,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--color-muted-foreground,oklch(0.5 0.02 50));text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:color 150ms,transform 150ms}.ds-nav__tab:hover{color:var(--color-foreground,oklch(0.22 0.02 50))}.ds-nav__tab:active{transform:scale(0.9)}.ds-nav__tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid oklch(0.58 0.14 42 / 0.5);outline-offset:-2px}.ds-nav__ico{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:28px;border-radius:9999px}.ds-nav__tab.is-on{color:var(--color-primary,oklch(0.58 0.14 42));font-weight:500}.ds-nav__tab.is-on .ds-nav__ico{background:oklch(0.58 0.14 42 / 0.12)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Map Pins",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "map-pin",
      "description": "State-coloured circular pins with a category glyph; the selected pin grows with a ring.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-pins\"><span class=\"ds-pin\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 2v2M14 2v2M6 2v2M16 8a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v8a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H7a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h14a4 4 0 1 1 0 8h-1\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-pin ds-pin--on\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m8 3 4 8 5-5 5 15H2L8 3z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-pin ds-pin--fav\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-pin ds-pin--wish\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-pin ds-pin--group\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-pins{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:20px 16px 12px;background:oklch(0.95 0.015 75)}.ds-pin{width:36px;height:36px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:2px solid #fff;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--color-primary,oklch(0.58 0.14 42));color:var(--color-primary-foreground,oklch(0.98 0.012 80));box-shadow:0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1),0 2px 4px -2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);transform:translateY(-4px);transition:width 200ms ease-out,height 200ms ease-out,box-shadow 200ms ease-out;cursor:pointer}.ds-pin:hover,.ds-pin--on{box-shadow:0 0 0 4px oklch(0.58 0.14 42 / 0.3),0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1)}.ds-pin--on{width:44px;height:44px}.ds-pin--fav{background:oklch(0.645 0.246 16.439);color:#fff}.ds-pin--wish{background:oklch(0.696 0.17 162.48);color:#fff}.ds-pin--group{background:oklch(0.685 0.169 237.323);color:#fff}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Editorial Header",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "display",
      "description": "Mono eyebrow, Fraunces title, italic lede; opens every top-level page.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-ed\"><p class=\"ds-ed__eyebrow\">— Ranking</p><h1 class=\"ds-ed__title\">Najlepsze miejsca paczki</h1><p class=\"ds-ed__lede\">Średnie z ocen wszystkich grup, w których jesteś.</p></header>",
      "css": ".ds-ed{max-width:42rem;color:var(--color-foreground,oklch(0.22 0.02 50))}.ds-ed__eyebrow{margin:0 0 8px;font:400 10px/1.5 'Geist Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:0.32em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(0.58 0.14 42 / 0.8)}.ds-ed__title{margin:0;font:400 30px/1.05 Fraunces,Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-0.025em}.ds-ed__lede{margin:8px 0 0;font:italic 400 14px/1.45 Outfit,system-ui,sans-serif;color:oklch(0.5 0.02 50)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Friends' Atlas",
    "overview": "PlaceMates looks like a private atlas kept by a group of friends: cartography on one side, editorial typography on the other. The ground is warm paper (never white-on-grey), the ink is espresso, and a single terracotta pigment marks everything that belongs to *us* — the active tab, the pins on the map, the primary action. Contour lines and a compass mark carry the cartographic thread; Fraunces headlines with a mono eyebrow carry the editorial one, so every screen reads as if written by the same hand.\n\nThe mood is warm, personal and cartographic. It is a phone-first tool used outdoors, so density is moderate, targets are generous (44px minimum on primary controls, 60px tab bar) and every tap answers with a small physical response. Components are warm and tactile: soft generous corners, press-to-shrink feedback, flat on the page and lifted only when they float above the map.\n\nConfirmed rejections: it must never feel like a utilitarian map tool (cool grey-blue Google-Maps neutrality) and never like generic SaaS (purple gradients, glassmorphism, cards-in-cards, dashboard chill).",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm paper ground with a faint dot grain; espresso ink, never pure black.",
      "One terracotta accent for \"ours / active / go\"; state colours appear only on map pins.",
      "Fraunces display + Outfit body + Geist Mono eyebrows.",
      "Cartographic signatures: CompassMark, self-drawing TopoLines, warm basemap.",
      "Flat in the page, lifted over the map.",
      "Tactile motion: press-scale, short fades, reduced-motion fully honoured."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Pigment Rule",
        "body": "Terracotta is the only accent in the chrome. Rose, emerald and sky exist to tell pin states apart on the map and in their matching hearts/toggles — never as decoration elsewhere.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Warm Ink Rule",
        "body": "No pure black and no cool grey. Every neutral sits on hue 50–80 with a trace of chroma; the dark theme stays warm too.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Same Hand Rule",
        "body": "Every top-level page opens with the editorial trio: mono eyebrow → Fraunces title → optional italic lede. Don't invent a different header shape for a new page.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Serif Names Places Rule",
        "body": "Place names and page titles are Fraunces; numbers, controls and metadata are Outfit with `tabular-nums` for scores.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Float Rule",
        "body": "Only things that sit above the map or above the page get a shadow. A card in a list never does.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep Terracotta as the single accent for active, selected and primary states.",
      "Do open every top-level page with the eyebrow → Fraunces title → italic lede trio.",
      "Do give every tappable thing at least 44px and a physical press response (`active:scale-90` on tabs, 0.97 on chips, 0.985 on cards, 1px nudge on buttons).",
      "Do keep chrome solid: sticky bars in Paper, floating map UI in 95% Paper. No backdrop blur over the map canvas.",
      "Do keep motion short and opacity-led (180ms view transitions, 400ms fade-up with 55ms stagger, 460ms `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` content rise) and leave the global reduced-motion override intact.",
      "Do use `tabular-nums` for scores, counts and averages."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't make it look like a utilitarian map tool: no cool grey-blue neutrals, no default basemap chrome, no unstyled MapLibre controls.",
      "Don't drift into generic SaaS: no purple or multi-stop gradients, no glassmorphism panels, no cards inside cards, no dashboard-grey surfaces.",
      "Don't use rose, emerald or sky outside pin states and their matching toggles.",
      "Don't add shadows to in-page cards or list rows.",
      "Don't use pure black, pure white text on terracotta, or `font-bold`; weight tops out at 600 in Outfit, and Fraunces carries emphasis through size.",
      "Don't apply `transform` to route-level wrappers; it breaks the map's fixed overlays and the sticky header."
    ]
  }
}